    "name": "Doomspire",
    "steam_appid": 3621050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doomspire</strong> is an epic, roguelike adventure card game set in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>, an ancient and cursed structure that spirals down into the abyss. Once a towering monument that pierced the heavens, the <strong>Doomspire</strong> now crumbles inward, its roots descending into darkness, where doom awaits all who descend. You will create your <strong>dwarven hero</strong> and venture deeper into the <strong>Doomspire</strong>, facing terrifying bosses, uncovering forgotten treasures, and battling for your very survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey is unique, as the <strong>Doomspire</strong> is procedurally generated with new paths, dangers, and mysteries waiting to be discovered. Collect powerful <strong>cards</strong> and <strong>relics</strong>, build synergies, and adapt your strategies as you progress. But beware\u2014the deeper you go, the darker and more perilous the journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Depths</strong>: Each run offers a <strong>new experience</strong>, with shifting paths, enemies, and treasures in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deck-Building</strong>: Collect and craft a <strong>unique deck</strong> for your hero. Use synergies, abilities, and powerful cards to create your perfect strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice Mechanics</strong>: Trade <strong>HP</strong>, <strong>minions</strong>, and <strong>resources</strong> for greater power. Risk and reward play a key role in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong>: Confront powerful bosses, each with their own unique abilities and strategies. Overcome them to gain valuable rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: Every descent into the <strong>Doomspire</strong> is different. With multiple builds, playstyles, and synergies to explore, no two runs are ever the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doomspire</strong> combines <strong>strategic deck-building</strong> with <strong>roguelike elements</strong>, where every choice matters. You\u2019ll need to balance your resources, make tough decisions, and adapt to the ever-changing environment of the <strong>Doomspire</strong>. The core focus is on crafting <strong>powerful synergies</strong> between cards and managing <strong>sacrificial mechanics</strong>, allowing for highly dynamic gameplay and endless replayability.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doomspire</strong> is an epic, roguelike adventure card game set in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>, an ancient and cursed structure that spirals down into the abyss. Once a towering monument that pierced the heavens, the <strong>Doomspire</strong> now crumbles inward, its roots descending into darkness, where doom awaits all who descend. You will create your <strong>dwarven hero</strong> and venture deeper into the <strong>Doomspire</strong>, facing terrifying bosses, uncovering forgotten treasures, and battling for your very survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey is unique, as the <strong>Doomspire</strong> is procedurally generated with new paths, dangers, and mysteries waiting to be discovered. Collect powerful <strong>cards</strong> and <strong>relics</strong>, build synergies, and adapt your strategies as you progress. But beware\u2014the deeper you go, the darker and more perilous the journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Depths</strong>: Each run offers a <strong>new experience</strong>, with shifting paths, enemies, and treasures in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deck-Building</strong>: Collect and craft a <strong>unique deck</strong> for your hero. Use synergies, abilities, and powerful cards to create your perfect strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice Mechanics</strong>: Trade <strong>HP</strong>, <strong>minions</strong>, and <strong>resources</strong> for greater power. Risk and reward play a key role in the <strong>Doomspire</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong>: Confront powerful bosses, each with their own unique abilities and strategies. Overcome them to gain valuable rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: Every descent into the <strong>Doomspire</strong> is different. With multiple builds, playstyles, and synergies to explore, no two runs are ever the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doomspire</strong> combines <strong>strategic deck-building</strong> with <strong>roguelike elements</strong>, where every choice matters. You\u2019ll need to balance your resources, make tough decisions, and adapt to the ever-changing environment of the <strong>Doomspire</strong>. The core focus is on crafting <strong>powerful synergies</strong> between cards and managing <strong>sacrificial mechanics</strong>, allowing for highly dynamic gameplay and endless replayability.</p>",
    "short_description": "Doomspire is a roguelike card game where you play a dwarven hero and venture deeper into the Doomspire, a dark and ancient structure. Face terrifying bosses, gather treasures, and strategically build your deck as you descend into the abyss, where doom awaits.",
